# Networking

## Check IP address

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ip addr"
```

## Check routing table

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ip route"
```

## Display network interfaces

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ip link"
```

## Test internet connectivity

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ping -c 4 google.com"
```

## Check DNS resolution

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "nslookup google.com"
```

## Check listening ports

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ss -tulpn"
```

## Display firewall status

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ufw status"
```

## Display open ports

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "netstat -tulpn"
```

## Check network connections

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ss -an"
```

## Check default gateway

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "ip route | grep default"
```
